{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09373","headline":"简寂观西涧瀑布下作 · 韦应物","name":"简寂观西涧瀑布下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淙流绝壁散，虚烟翠涧深。\n丛际松风起，飘来洒尘襟。\n窥萝翫猿鸟，解组傲云林。\n茶果邀真侣，觞酌洽同心。\n旷岁怀兹赏，行春始重寻。\n聊将横吹笛，一写山水音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}